# Board: phone

A board that hears two channels, the console and the phone. Both may ask for a change and both
can answer a card. A card is answered only on a channel with `cards: true`, and a card nobody
answers within `unanswered_card` seconds is a No.

```json
{
  "stew": "2026-11-08-draft",
  "kind": "board",
  "name": "phone",
  "supports": ["2026-11-08-draft"],
  "bounds": [
    {
      "id": "keys",
      "rule": "No secret file (.env, a private key, a credentials file) is read, printed or passed on.",
      "at": ["request", "call"]
    }
  ],
  "profiles": ["profiles/note-writer.us"],
  "default_profile": "note-writer",
  "channels": [
    { "name": "console", "may": "change", "cards": true },
    { "name": "phone", "may": "change", "cards": true }
  ],
  "accelerators": 1,
  "unanswered_card": 600,
  "ledger": "run/ledger.jsonl"
}
```
